}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CNM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CNM.png","website":"https://www.coreandmain.com","ceo":"Mark R. Witkowski","full_time_employees":"5600","description":"Core & Main, Inc. (CNM) is a leading supplier of vital infrastructure products and services across the United States. The company specializes in providing comprehensive solutions for water, wastewater, storm drainage, and fire protection systems. Their diverse clientele includes local governments (municipalities), privately owned water utilities, and a wide array of professional contractors working on projects in the residential, non-residential (commercial), and public sectors. Core & Main's extensive product range features essential components such as pipes, valves, hydrants, and fittings. For storm drainage needs, they offer systems including corrugated piping, retention basins, inline drains, manholes, grates, and geosynthetics. Their fire protection inventory covers crucial items like fire protection pipes, sprinkler heads, complete fire suppression systems, related accessories, and specialized fabrication services. Additionally, they provide advanced metering products, including smart meter technology, alongside installation services and software solutions. These specialized materials and services are integral to the construction, maintenance, repair, and replacement of critical water and fire protection infrastructure. Established in 1874, Core & Main is headquartered in St. Louis, Missouri.","description_en":"Core & Main, Inc. (CNM) is a leading supplier of vital infrastructure products and services across the United States. The company specializes in providing comprehensive solutions for water, wastewater, storm drainage, and fire protection systems. Their diverse clientele includes local governments (municipalities), privately owned water utilities, and a wide array of professional contractors working on projects in the residential, non-residential (commercial), and public sectors. Core & Main's extensive product range features essential components such as pipes, valves, hydrants, and fittings. For storm drainage needs, they offer systems including corrugated piping, retention basins, inline drains, manholes, grates, and geosynthetics. Their fire protection inventory covers crucial items like fire protection pipes, sprinkler heads, complete fire suppression systems, related accessories, and specialized fabrication services. Additionally, they provide advanced metering products, including smart meter technology, alongside installation services and software solutions. These specialized materials and services are integral to the construction, maintenance, repair, and replacement of critical water and fire protection infrastructure. Established in 1874, Core & Main is headquartered in St. Louis, Missouri.","description_zh":"Core & Main, Inc.（美股代碼：CNM）為 Industrials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Industrial - Distribution 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"1830 Craig Park Court","city":"Saint Louis","state":"MO","zip":"63146","country":"US","phone":"314 432 4700","full_address":"1830 Craig Park Court, Saint Louis, MO 63146, US","range_52w":"39.415-59.66","year_high":59.66,"year_low":39.415,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":39.415,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-20","name":"Witkowski Mark R","title":"director, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"G-Gift","shares":19596,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-05","name":"Harper Carla D","title":"officer: Senior VP, Human Resources","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":242,"price":46.32,"total_val":0.01},{"date":"2026-07-23","name":"HUEBERT MICHAEL G.","title":"officer: President","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":1301,"price":43.75,"total_val":0.06},{"date":"2026-07-08","name":"Hope James D","title":"direct